<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">Financial Results were reviewed by Audit Committee &amp; approved by Board at meeting held on 14.11.2024, prepared in accordance with IND AS. Chief Operating Decision Maker reviews operations as whole, single primary business segment viz. product and systems for electricity distribution hence no reportable segments as per Ind AS 108. During their quarter, Finance Act 2024 was enacted, introducing amendments to calculation of long-term capital gains. Act reduced tax rate on long term capital gains from 20 to 12.5% (excluding surcharge and education cess) As a result of these amendments, Company has reversed deferred tax liability of INR 580 Lakh during this quarter. Previous period figures are reclassified wherever necessary. Company has no subsidiary/associate/joint venture as on 30.09.2024. Face value of shares in INR</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
